    "title": "fix(checkpoint): widen `Store` `put` value type to `Mapping[str, Any]`",
    "user": {
      "login": "navarra-lisandro",
      "id": 126367187,
      "node_id": "U_kgDOB4g10w",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126367187?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/navarra-lisandro",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/navarra-lisandro",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/navarra-lisandro/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/navarra-lisandro/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/navarra-lisandro/gists{/gist_id}",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/navarra-lisandro/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/navarra-lisandro/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/navarra-lisandro/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/navarra-lisandro/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/navarra-lisandro/events{/privacy}",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/navarra-lisandro/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "TypedDict values don't structurally satisfy dict[str, Any] since dict implies full mutability. Mapping[str, Any] accepts both plain dicts and TypedDicts while still requiring string keys, matching what put() actually needs from callers.\r\n\r\nFixes #8616\r\n\r\nVerified by running lint/type/test locally across checkpoint, checkpoint-sqlite, checkpoint-postgres, prebuilt, sdk-py, and a scoped langgraph subset.\r\n\r\nLinkedIn: https://linkedin.com/in/lisandro-navarra\r\n",
    "created_at": "2026-08-13T20:28:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-28T13:05:08Z",
